# TrainTrack title system

Typography is determined by **semantic hierarchy**, not by page. Do not invent one-off heading styles.

Families: **Inter** (UI) + **Bebas Neue** (page H1 / large workout titles only).

CSS classes live in `src/app/globals.css`. React helpers in `src/components/ui/typography.tsx` and `src/components/ui/page-header.tsx`. Tokens in `src/lib/design-tokens.ts` (`typography.*`).

**Live reference:** `/style-guide` · redesign mocks `/design-mockups/*`

## Levels

| Level | Class / component | Font | Use |
|---|---|---|---|
| **1 Page H1** | `title-display` / `title-page` · `PageHeader` · `PageHeaderTitle` | Bebas · **48px** (3rem) · uppercase | Every app screen H1 — Training, Stats, Library, Season |
| **1 Compact** | `title-display--compact` · `size="compact"` | Bebas · **30px** (1.875rem) | Nested edit screens / month expanded |
| **2 Section** | `title-section` / `SectionTitle` | Inter 16px · uppercase | Content sections — `UPCOMING`, `TODAY'S WORKOUT` |
| **3 Eyebrow** | `title-eyebrow` / `PageHeaderEyebrow` | Inter 11px · 0.08em · uppercase | Overlines — `TRAINING · COACH`, `NEXT RACE` |
| **4 Card** | `title-card` / `CardTitle` | Inter 15px sentence case | Workout/race names — `Easy Ride` |
| **Day** | `title-day` / `DayLabel` | Inter 10px uppercase | `WEDNESDAY 12 AUG` |
| **Support** | `PageHeaderDescription` | Inter 13px soft | Subtitle under page H1 |

Bebas is **only** for Level 1 page H1s (and XL/L workout titles). Section titles are never Bebas.

## Page headers (required)

Use `PageHeader` for every top-level screen:

```tsx
<PageHeader
  eyebrow="Training · Coach"
  title="Week plan"
  description={`${athlete} · ${weekLabel}`}
  action={<Controls />}
/>
```

Or compose: `PageHeaderEyebrow` · `PageHeaderTitle` · `PageHeaderDescription` · `PageHeaderActions`.

Use `size="compact"` only on nested edit screens.

## Critical don'ts

- Do **not** invent one-off H1 fonts/sizes — use `PageHeader` / `PageHeaderTitle`
- Do **not** use Bebas in navigation, section titles, table headers, or calendar day headers
- Do **not** uppercase workout names (`EASY RIDE`)
- Do **not** put display type inside table cells
- Do **not** accent individual words in page H1s
- Do **not** mix Inter bold `title-page` with Bebas — both classes are the same Level 1 now

## Components

- `PageHeader` → Level 1 page chrome
- `SectionTitle` → Level 2
- Season / Home greeting → `PageHeaderTitle` (same Level 1)
- Home sections (Today's workout, Upcoming) → `title-section`
